ment)\">// 还是同一个 b</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-comment)\">// 类型也有作用域：默认是模块级的</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\">type</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-function)\"> Id</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-keyword)\"> =</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-token-constant)\"> string</span><span style=\"color:var(--shiki-foreground)\">;</span></span></code></pre>",
